<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the sixth day of the $US7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, third round</p>
<p>5-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Jens Knippschild (Germany) 6-4 7-6 (7-2) 6-3</p>
<p>10-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 6-4 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Women's singles, third round</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 6-1 6-3  </p>
<p>Add men's singles, third round</p>
<p>8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-4 6-4 6-7 (3-7) 6-1</p>
<p>Add women's singles, third round</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat 2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) 1-6 6-4 8-6</p>
<p>9-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Wang Shi-Ting (Taiwan) 6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>15-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat Sandra Kleinova (Czech Republic) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Kristina Brandi (U.S.) 6-1 6-1</p>
</text>
